y Area (GBA) will also cultivate talent to serve Hong Kong and the wider metropolitan GBA. For more information about the University, please visit https://www.hkmu.edu.hk . We are now looking for a suitable person to fill the following position in the Wu Jieh Yee School of Arts and Social Sciences : Lecturer / Assistant Lecturer / Teaching Assistant (Creative Advertising and Media Design Programme) (A&SS) - ( 260026S ) Job : Full-time Academic School/Unit : Wu Jieh Yee School of Arts and Social Sciences Closing Date : 21/Oct/2026, 8:59:00 AM Major Duties and Responsibilities The appointee will be responsible mainly for the following: Planning, development, coordination and delivery of courses (including classroom and/or studio teaching) in advertising, design, media culture and communication, copywriting, or media management at both undergraduate and postgraduate levels; Undertaking/engaging in academic research and/or creative production activities; Undertaking/engaging in scholarly and professional activities; Participating in School/University activities and administration; and Performing any other duties as assigned by the Dean (A&SS) or his/her nominee(s). Candidates Candidates should possess the following qualifications, experience and competence: A higher degree , preferably an earned doctorate, in advertising, design, media culture and communication, copywriting, or media management, or in a relevant discipline with relevant teaching/professional experience including programme and course administration; Record of research and peer-reviewed publications, involvement in professional and community services & activities; and Teaching experience with an interdisciplinary approach will be an advantage; A good command of English and Chinese (both Cantonese and Putonghua) ; and Forward-thinking in terms of programme development, familiar with industrial practices, and knowledgeable about local and international educational standards in the professions. The level of 